privacy_pool_program (DGHJjbUsSzAiSypH4dupxkQK1WLVcevvYchmM7mNLn9D)
13 instructions; accounts: 8 fixed, 3 keyed, 19 caller-chosen; 7 hotspots (0 allowed)

Hotspots
  A fixed account has one address for every caller, so every instruction that
  writes it takes the same write lock.

  pool_config
    address  Ft792WYvArLSrWesc8wpDEvpSH31Tg58pdCnVT984gh7
    seeds    "privacy-pool-config"
    writers  initialize, deposit
    readers  set_verification_key, set_custodians, register_requester, withdraw, request_disclosure, resolve_challenge, approve_disclosure
